#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:50
msgid ""
"Allow both supervisors to reach the database and each other's actor, binlog and "
"checkpoint ports. Nginx must reach both supervisor APIs. Workers must reach the "
"primary API, and both supervisors must reach worker actor ports. Do not use loopback "
"addresses for communication between hosts."
msgstr ""
"Permita que ambos supervisors accedan a la base de datos y a los puertos actor, "
"binlog y checkpoint del otro. Nginx debe poder acceder a las API de ambos "
"supervisors. Los workers deben poder acceder a la API del primario, y ambos "
"supervisors deben poder acceder a los puertos actor de los workers. No utilice "
"direcciones de loopback para la comunicación entre hosts."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:53
msgid "Prepare the database and nodes"
msgstr "Preparar la base de datos y los nodos"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:55
msgid ""
"Both supervisors must use the same shared database, not separate local SQLite "
"databases. The database stores API, permission, task and instance records; binlog and"
" checkpoint synchronize supervisor runtime metadata. These mechanisms have different "
"responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"Ambos supervisors deben usar la misma base de datos compartida, no bases de datos "
"SQLite locales independientes. La base de datos almacena los registros de API, "
"permisos, tareas e instancias; binlog y checkpoint sincronizan los metadatos de "
"ejecución de los supervisors. Estos mecanismos tienen responsabilidades distintas."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:57
msgid ""
"Configure one database URL on both supervisors. Using the same configuration on "
"workers keeps the environment consistent. The image must include the corresponding "
"database driver."
msgstr ""
"Configure una misma URL de base de datos en ambos supervisors. Usar la misma "
"configuración en los workers mantiene la coherencia del entorno. La imagen debe "
"incluir el controlador de base de datos correspondiente."

