#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:73
msgid ""
"Confirm the supervisor and worker commands exist, inspect the supervisor's supported "
"options, and choose the working directory used by the image."
msgstr ""
"Confirme que existen los comandos de supervisor y worker, revise las opciones "
"admitidas por el supervisor y elija el directorio de trabajo que utiliza la imagen."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:82
msgid ""
"Before starting processes, check the ports allocated to that node. For the secondary "
"use ports 9992, 9912, 9552 and 9652; for the worker use port 9921."
msgstr ""
"Antes de iniciar los procesos, compruebe los puertos asignados a ese nodo. Para el "
"secundario utilice los puertos 9992, 9912, 9552 y 9652; para el worker, el puerto "
"9921."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:84
msgid "Primary-node port check"
msgstr "Comprobación de puertos del nodo primario"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:101
msgid "Start the cluster"
msgstr "Iniciar el clúster"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:103
msgid ""
"Run each command on its designated node, after exporting the shared database URL. "
"Logs are written to the working directory."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute cada comando en el nodo designado, después de exportar la URL de la base de "
"datos compartida. Los registros se escriben en el directorio de trabajo."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst
msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Primario"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst
msgid "Secondary"
msgstr "Secundario"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:150
msgid "Configure the unified entry"
msgstr "Configurar la entrada unificada"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:152
msgid ""
"Run the HA script on the Nginx node. It renders the OpenResty configuration and "
"starts or reloads Nginx. The supplied script supports two supervisor backends; "
"additional backends need a separate load-balancer configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute el script de HA en el nodo Nginx. Genera la configuración de OpenResty e "
"inicia o recarga Nginx. El script proporcionado admite dos backends de supervisor; "
"para backends adicionales se necesita una configuración de balanceador de carga "
"independiente."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:163
msgid ""
"The entry checks both supervisors' status endpoints and routes requests to the "
"available primary. Use the unified entry for model deployment and client requests."
msgstr ""
"La entrada comprueba los endpoints de estado de ambos supervisors y enruta las "
"solicitudes al primario disponible. Utilice la entrada unificada para el despliegue "
"de modelos y las solicitudes de los clientes."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:175
msgid "Acceptance checks"
msgstr "Comprobaciones de aceptación"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:177
msgid "Check both supervisors directly and then check the unified entry."
msgstr "Compruebe directamente ambos supervisors y, a continuación, la entrada unificada."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:189
msgid ""
"Expect version information from the primary, ``it is a secondary supervisor`` from "
"the secondary version endpoint, and the worker in both status responses. Initially "
"the unified entry reports ``has_transfered=false`` and ``active_node=primary``."
msgstr ""
"Se espera información de versión del primario,  ``it is a secondary supervisor``  "
"desde el endpoint de versión del secundario, y el worker en ambas respuestas de "
"estado. Inicialmente, la entrada unificada informa  ``has_transfered=false``  y  "
"``active_node=primary`` ."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:191
msgid ""
"Deploy a model through the unified entry and test actual inference. Inspect both "
"supervisor logs for synchronized replica routing metadata before testing failover."
msgstr ""
"Despliegue un modelo a través de la entrada unificada y pruebe una inferencia real. "
"Revise los registros de ambos supervisors para comprobar que los metadatos de "
"enrutamiento de réplicas están sincronizados antes de probar la conmutación por "
"error."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:198
msgid ""
"Successful secondary replay of ``META_REPLICA_MAP_INFO`` indicates that replica-to-"
"worker routes were synchronized."
msgstr ""
"Una reproducción correcta de  ``META_REPLICA_MAP_INFO``  en el secundario indica que "
"las rutas de réplica a worker se sincronizaron."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:201
msgid "Optional failover drill and recovery"
msgstr "Simulacro opcional de conmutación por error y recuperación"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst
msgid "Test a primary failure in a test environment"
msgstr "Probar un fallo del primario en un entorno de pruebas"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:205
msgid ""
"This drill intentionally stops the primary supervisor. Run it separately from routine"
" installation and only in the environment chosen for failure testing."
msgstr ""
"Este simulacro detiene intencionadamente el supervisor primario. Ejecútelo por "
"separado de la instalación habitual y solo en el entorno elegido para las pruebas de "
"fallos."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:207
msgid "On the example primary node:"
msgstr "En el nodo primario de ejemplo:"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:215
msgid ""
"Poll the secondary version endpoint. Once it returns version information instead of "
"the secondary-role message, inspect promotion and worker-reconnection logs."
msgstr ""
"Consulte periódicamente el endpoint de versión del secundario. Cuando devuelva "
"información de versión en lugar del mensaje de rol secundario, revise los registros "
"de promoción y de reconexión de los workers."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:223
msgid "Expected log indicators"
msgstr "Indicadores esperados en los registros"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:230
msgid ""
"Check the unified entry again. The recorded configuration checks approximately every "
"two seconds and switches after five failures; this is a configuration-specific "
"timing, not a guaranteed recovery time."
msgstr ""
"Vuelva a comprobar la entrada unificada. La configuración documentada realiza una "
"comprobación aproximadamente cada dos segundos y conmuta tras cinco fallos; se trata "
"de una temporización específica de esta configuración, no de un tiempo de "
"recuperación garantizado."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:238
msgid ""
"Expect ``has_transfered=true`` and ``active_node=backup``, with the old primary down "
"and the backup up. Send a real chat request to the already deployed model through the"
" same entry."
msgstr ""
"Se espera  ``has_transfered=true``  y  ``active_node=backup`` , con el antiguo "
"primario caído y el nodo de respaldo activo. Envíe una solicitud de chat real al "
"modelo ya desplegado a través de la misma entrada."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:240
msgid ""
"If inference cannot find the model, inspect the new primary's routing logs and the "
"earlier replica-map replay. A successful role change alone does not establish that "
"the model is still reachable."
msgstr ""
"Si la inferencia no encuentra el modelo, revise los registros de enrutamiento del "
"nuevo primario y la reproducción anterior del mapa de réplicas. Un cambio de rol "
"correcto por sí solo no demuestra que el modelo siga siendo accesible."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:246
msgid ""
"After recovering the former primary, rejoin it as a secondary with the current "
"primary's addresses and the same shared database. Avoid automatically reclaiming the "
"primary role. Verify metadata synchronization, node status and inference again."
msgstr ""
"Tras recuperar el antiguo primario, vuelva a incorporarlo como secundario con las "
"direcciones del primario actual y la misma base de datos compartida. Evite que "
"recupere automáticamente el rol de primario. Vuelva a verificar la sincronización de "
"metadatos, el estado de los nodos y la inferencia."

